# openOODA/INDEX — The Polyrepo

File: openOODA/docs/INDEX.oot

This file is the overview of the openOODA project as a whole. It is the
front-door copy for human visitors. The agent-facing front door is
`ANCHOR.oo` at this repo root.

## 1. What it is

The openOODA polyrepo. Thirteen independent repositories that
together form a capability-secure systems language. Every
effect requires an explicit capability token. Each repo owns
its own surface and release. The compiler is the substrate.
The other repos are siblings.

## 2. Surface

Thirteen repos. The Tag column below is a *snapshot*; per RULES.oot §1.24 the
release tag is derived from git history on every push to main. For the
authoritative current state, run:

  git ls-remote --tags https://github.com/openOODA/<repo> | tail -3

Each website page cites `openOODA/{repo}/docs/`. The snapshot below was taken
2026-09-12 and is preserved for human readers who want a stable reference.

